#: includes/TTA_Notices.php:282
#: production/text-to-audio/includes/TTA_Notices.php:282
msgid "The free version uses the browser's built-in speechSynthesis API. Voice and language support varies by browser and device, so some combinations may not work as expected. The Pro version uses server-side audio generation for consistent results across all browsers."
